@startuml EMREX_2.0_Flow_ServerSide
autonumber "<b>[000]"

title **EMREX Flow**

skinparam monochrome false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

participant "EMC Frontend" as emc_fe
participant "EMC Backend" as emc_bff
participant "EMP Frontend" as emp_fe
participant "EMP Backend" as emp_bff
participant "EMP Resource Server" as emp_rs
participant "EMREG" as emreg

== 1. Institution Selection ==
emc_fe -> emc_fe: EMC User login
emc_fe -> emc_bff: Get available EMPs
emc_bff -> emreg: GET /emp-list
emreg --> emc_bff: EMP data
emc_bff --> emc_fe: EMP data
emc_fe -> emc_fe: Show EMP selection UI
emc_fe -> emc_fe: Select EMP

== 2. Authorization Request Preparation ==
emc_fe -> emc_bff: Prepare auth request for selected EMP

group **PKCE preparation**
  emc_bff -> emc_bff: **PKCE RFC 7636**\ncode_verifier = BASE64URL(SHA256(random(32)))\ncode_challenge = BASE64URL(SHA256(code_verifier))
  emc_bff -> emc_bff: Store code_verifier + state in session\n(linked to EMC session)
end group

emc_bff --> emc_fe: Authorization URL parameters
emc_fe -> emp_bff: HTTP 302 Redirect to EMP with url-params:\n**Oauth2 params RFC 6749**\nclient_id=EMC_CLIENT_ID\nredirect_uri=EMC_REDIRECT_URI\nresponse_type=code\nstate=CSRF_TOKEN\nscope(optional??)=userinfo%20elmo\n**PKCE params RFC 7636**\ncode_challenge=CODE_CHALLENGE\ncode_challenge_method=S256

== 3. EMP Client Verification and result selection ==
emp_bff -> emreg: GET /clients/EMC_CLIENT_ID\nAuthorization: Bearer EMP_API_TOKEN -> **Details to be decided**
emreg --> emp_bff: Client metadata with EMREG_EMC_PUBLIC_KEY and EMREG_EMC_REDIRECT_URI

group **Validation EMREG_EMC_REDIRECT_URI**
  emp_bff -> emp_bff: Validate EMC_REDIRECT_URI against EMREG_EMC_REDIRECT_URI
end group

group **Do Emrex stuf**
  emp_bff -> emp_fe: HTTP 302 Redirect to EMP (login)
  emp_fe -> emp_fe: User logs in at EMP
  emp_fe -> emp_bff: Get results
  emp_bff --> emp_fe: Results for selection
  emp_fe -> emp_fe: Show results selection UI

  emp_fe -> emp_fe: User selects results + consent
  emp_fe -> emp_bff: Store user selection and user info and consent (ref_id=UUID(), selected_results=[...])
  emp_bff -> emp_rs: Store user selection and user info (ref_id=UUID(), selected_results=[...])
  emp_rs -> emp_bff:
  emp_bff -> emp_bff: Store user consent
end group

group **Authorization Code Generation**
  emp_bff -> emp_bff: Generate auth code (code=AUTH_CODE_123)
  emp_bff -> emp_bff: Bind code to:\n- ref_id:UUID()\n- selected_results:[...]\n- client_id:EMC_CLIENT_ID\n- redirect_uri:EMC_REDIRECT_URI
end group

emp_bff -> emc_fe: HTTP 302 Redirect to EMC_REDIRECT_URI\n**PKCE Params**\ncode=AUTH_CODE_123\nstate=CSRF_TOKEN
emc_fe -> emc_bff: Continue at 4: Callback Handling


== 4. Callback Handling (EMC Server) ==
emc_bff -> emc_bff: Receive callback with auth code + state
emc_bff -> emc_bff: Validate state matches session
emc_bff -> emc_bff: Retrieve code_verifier from session

== 5. Token Exchange ==
emc_bff -> emc_bff: **JWT Client Authentication params RFC 7523**\nGenerate signed JWT with:\n- Header: alg=RS256, typ=JWT, kid=EMC_KEY_ID\n- Payload: iss=EMC_CLIENT_ID, sub=EMC_CLIENT_ID, aud=EMP_TOKEN_URL,\n jti=UUID(), iat=current_timestamp, exp=iat+300, nbf=iat, azp=EMC_CLIENT_ID
emc_bff -> emp_bff: **Token Request (RFC 6749)**\nPOST /token with:\n**OAuth2 Parameters RFC 6749:**\ngrant_type=authorization_code\ncode=AUTH_CODE_123\nredirect_uri=EMC_REDIRECT_URI\ncode_verifier=CODE_VERIFIER\n**JWT Client Auth (RFC 7523):**\nclient_assertion_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:client-assertion-type:jwt-bearer\nclient_assertion=SIGNED_JWT

emp_bff -> emreg: GET /clients/EMC_CLIENT_ID\nAuthorization: Bearer EMP_API_TOKEN
emreg --> emp_bff: Client metadata with public key

group **Token Validation and Access Token generation**
  emp_bff -> emp_bff: Verify JWT signature with EMC public key
  emp_bff -> emp_bff: Validate code_verifier against code_challenge
  emp_bff -> emp_bff: Generate acces token:\n- access_token: ACCESS_TOKEN_456\n- id_token: ID_TOKEN_789\n- expires_in: 120\n -user_identifcation: [Elmo Learner] Security issues? Leaking personal info from access token\n- token_type: Bearer
end group

emp_bff --> emc_bff: Access token

== 6. Data Retrieval with Signed Responses ==
group **ELMO XML**
  emc_bff -> emp_rs: GET /results?data_format=elmo&data_format_version=XX\ndata_format_version is optional. No param means you get latest version\nBad request (40X) when combination is not supported by EMP\nAuthorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_456\nX-Request-ID: REQ_12345
  emp_rs -> emp_rs: Sign response with EMP private key
  emp_rs --> emc_bff: Signed ELMO XML\nX-Signature: EMP_SIGNATURE_ABC123\nX-Signature-Algorithm: RS256\n Empty results (204 (no content?))
end group

group **User Info Elmo learner **
  emc_bff -> emp_rs: GET /results?data_format=userinfo&data_format_version=XX\nAuthorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_456
  emp_rs -> emp_rs: Sign response with EMP private key
  emp_rs --> emc_bff: Application/xml?\nX-Signature: EMP_SIGNATURE_DEF456\nX-Signature-Algorithm: RS256\n Empty results (204 (no content?))
end group

group **EIDAS User Info [Optional]**
  emc_bff -> emp_rs: GET /results?data_format=eidas\nAuthorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_456
  emp_rs -> emp_rs: Sign response with EMP private key
  emp_rs --> emc_bff: application/json\nX-Signature: EMP_SIGNATURE_DEF456\nX-Signature-Algorithm: RS256\n Empty results (204 (no content?))
end group

group **PDF Meta data [Optional]**
  emc_bff -> emp_rs: GET /results?data_format=pdf_metadata\nAuthorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_456
  emp_rs -> emp_rs: Sign response with EMP private key
  emp_rs --> emc_bff: application/json\nX-Signature: EMP_SIGNATURE_DEF456\nX-Signature-Algorithm: RS256\n Empty results (204 (no content?))\n Return list of PDF id's
end group

group **PDF Document [Optional]**
  emc_bff -> emp_rs: GET /results?data_format=pdf&pdf_id={pdf_id}\nAuthorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_456
  emp_rs -> emp_rs: Sign response with EMP private key
  emp_rs --> emc_bff: PDF document\nX-Signature: EMP_SIGNATURE_DEF456\nX-Signature-Algorithm: RS256\n Empty results (204 (no content?))\n
end group

group **ELM JSON [Optional]**
  emc_bff -> emp_rs: GET /results?data_format=elm&data_format_version=XX\nAuthorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_456
  emp_rs -> emp_rs: Sign response with EMP private key
  emp_rs --> emc_bff: ELM JSON\nX-Signature: EMP_SIGNATURE_GHI789\nX-Signature-Algorithm: RS256\n Empty results (204 (no content?))
end group

group **Revocation [Optional] <Think about>**
  emc_bff -> emp_rs: GET /results?data_format=revocations\nAuthorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_456
  emp_rs -> emp_rs: Sign response with EMP private key
  emp_rs --> emc_bff: Revocation list\nX-Signature: EMP_SIGNATURE_GHI789\nX-Signature-Algorithm: RS256\n Empty results (204 (no content?))
end group

emc_bff -> emc_fe: Retrieved results
emc_fe -> emc_fe: Review retrieved results

@enduml